# .cursorrules for Freebuff Workspace

You are working on the Freebuff AI Engineering Workspace at `/mnt/sdcard/PROJECTS/workstation/freebuff`.

## Context files

- `BUFFY.md` — main agent manifest (read first)
- `AGENTS.md` — quick agent protocol
- `BUFFY_PROJECT.md` — architecture and roadmap
- `SPEC.md` — technical specification
- `TASK.md` — current task
- `CHANGELOG.md` — recent changes

## Rules

1. Read `BUFFY.md` before making any changes.
2. Follow existing conventions in `scripts/` and `core/`.
3. Run `python -m pytest tests/ -v` and `python -m mypy scripts/ core/ --ignore-missing-imports` after significant changes.
4. Update `CHANGELOG.md` and relevant docs when architecture changes.
5. Keep secrets in `.env` and `.keys/`, never in code.
6. Prefer minimal changes and reuse existing helpers.
